cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite the paper below."
title: "Threshold Calibration vs. 3D Structure in Multi-Label GHS Hazard Classification"
abstract: >-
  Code, dataset, trained weights and experiment scripts for a study of which
  modelling choices govern multi-label GHS hazard prediction at regulatory
  scale: per-class decision-threshold calibration is worth several times more
  macro-F1 than adding a 3D molecular representation.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dialoveyou/ghs-hybrid-gnn"
authors:
